[{"id":2703385550,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6hImPO","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected in all rendering methods.\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [test_pr_102708.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19371398/test_pr_102708.zip)\r\n\r\n\r\nForward+ | Mobile | Compatibility\r\n-|-|-\r\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/24ff61c5-3068-4a75-b427-241e892941da) | ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/96c7f2bf-1d3b-4323-b943-d94c5b7923db) | ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/088a0454-eba2-4980-bd10-841d0409d87b)\r\n\r\nSome feedback:\r\n\r\n- The spatial shader template should include a commented out `post_light()` function to improve discoverability of this feature, similar to what's done for `light()` already:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/12384d93db851f210d785194d6bb72073bdeace4/editor/shader_create_dialog.cpp#L156-L170\r\n\r\nI would add something like this after `light()`:\r\n\r\n```glsl\r\n//void post_light() {\r\n//\t// Called for every pixel the material is visible on.\r\n//\t// Unlike `fragment()`, this runs after lighting has been processed.\r\n//}\r\n```","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102708#pullrequestreview-2703385550","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102708","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-03-20T16:22:31Z"},{"id":2748799831,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6j11tX","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"